  "name": "TestUs130AppTransform",
  "description": "US-130 clinics imported from a file, with two app-based transformers chained and a built-in between them: combine-rows folds diag_1 and diag_2 into one value, Remove Columns drops the two it consumed, split-rows takes the combined value apart again and restores them. The chain is a round trip, so the imported data must match a plain file import - which is what makes a batching regression visible, and proves a removed column can be rebuilt by a later step.",
